            <ArticleTitle>[Treatment for asthma and international recommendations].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>325-31</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This is a short review of current &quot;asthma guidelines&quot;. It is an opportunity to discuss briefly the pro and cons of the guidelines as such, and also of the Evidence-Based Medicine (EBM), as well as the links between guidelines and EBM. We try to define what are the guidelines and what they are not.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
